==========================================================
LeetCode SQL 50

Problem Number : 584
Problem Name   : Find Customer Referee
Difficulty     : Easy

Problem Link   : https://leetcode.com/problems/find-customer-referee/

----------------------------------------------------------
Approach
----------------------------------------------------------
- Retrieve the names of customers.
- Exclude customers whose referee_id is equal to 2.
- Include customers whose referee_id is NULL.

----------------------------------------------------------
Time Complexity : O(n)
Space Complexity: O(1)
==========================================================
Query:

SELECT
    name
FROM Customer
WHERE referee_id <> 2
   OR referee_id IS NULL;
